# Cloudflare Pages headers. https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# NOTE: Pages *combines* a header set by several matching rules — it does not let
# a more specific path override it. Two Content-Security-Policy headers would be
# enforced as their intersection, which breaks /admin. So there is ONE CSP here,
# wide enough to also cover the Sveltia CMS on /admin (unpkg + GitHub API + the
# OAuth broker at auth.tiredpilots.ca). The CMS is still noindex, sign-in gated,
# and its script is version-pinned + SRI-locked in /admin/index.html.
#
# COOP is same-origin-allow-popups, not same-origin: the CMS sign-in opens the
# OAuth broker in a popup and the broker's callback calls window.opener.postMessage
# to hand back the token. same-origin would null out window.opener and the popup
# would hang blank. We don't use crossOriginIsolated / SharedArrayBuffer, so the
# looser value costs nothing here.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://unpkg.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; worker-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com https://unpkg.com https://api.github.com https://raw.githubusercontent.com https://*.githubusercontent.com https://auth.tiredpilots.ca; manifest-src 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# The CMS admin shell — keep it out of search and out of the cache.
/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# Long-cache fingerprinted build assets.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/pagefind/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
